          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fig. 2.2 shows the distribution of grey wolf populations in south-west Europe in 1970 and 2012. No grey wolves from captive-breeding populations were released into the wild in south-west Europe during the period from 1970 to 2012.",
